Package: termux-vapt
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-vapt <termux-vapt@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/yashas-13/termux-vapt
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python (>= 3.10), nmap
Recommends: thc-hydra, radare2, jadx, apktool, android-tools-adb
Description: VAPT orchestration for Termux
 Runs a 5-phase vulnerability assessment pipeline with detailed PoC capture.
 Includes authorization gate, HTML/Markdown reports, and findings deduplication.
 Works with nmap, ffuf, sqlmap; handles nuclei SIGSYS via python fallback.
